# A re-judged row whose identity the receiver already dead-lettered files a
# fresh record instead of rewriting the one keyed by its source identity, so
# every anti-entropy re-ship of a standing divergence grows the dead-letter
# queue (#5714).
MODULE: DivergenceAccountedReDeliveryAppends
TARGET: DivergenceAccounted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a repaired dead-lettered row appends another dead-letter record
PERTURBS: Repair

--- FIND
    /\ IF dl[e] = 1 THEN Rediverted(e) ELSE Ingest(e, FALSE)
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF dl[e] = 1 THEN (dl' = [dl EXCEPT ![e] = @ + 1] /\ UNCHANGED <<st, tag>>) ELSE Ingest(e, FALSE)
--- END
